chx:X_SyntheticVersusReal a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:SyntheticVersusReal ; rdfs:label "send_event"@en ; skos:definition "A key pressed by PyAutoGUI reached the window with send_event False, while the letter q sent with XSendEvent arrived with send_event True, and both were typed into the entry, giving wq."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch23/research> .
