chx:X_WindowsSendInput a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:WindowsSendInput ; rdfs:label "ctypes.windll"@en ; skos:definition "SendInput, mouse_event and keybd_event occur in the Windows backend file, which this Linux machine can read but not run, because sys.platform is linux and ctypes has no windll, so the Windows input path was NOT EXECUTED."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch23/research> .
