chx:X_FailsafeCorners a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:FailsafeCorners ; rdfs:label "pyautogui.FAILSAFE_POINTS"@en ; skos:definition "The corners (0, 0), (1919, 0), (0, 1079) and (1919, 1079) make the next call raise FailSafeException but (1, 1), (1918, 1078) and (960, 0) do not, and moveTo(5000, 5000) stops at the lower right corner (1919, 1079) and raises."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch23/research> .
