chx:X_FailsafePointsFixed a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:FailsafePointsFixed ; rdfs:label "pyautogui.FAILSAFE_POINTS after a resize"@en ; skos:definition "FAILSAFE_POINTS is computed when pyautogui is imported: after the screen was resized from 1920 by 1080 to 1280 by 720 the running process still said 1920 by 1080, the pointer stopped at (1279, 719) and click raised nothing, while a new process saw (1280, 720) and the corner (1279, 719)."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch23/research> .
