chx:X_TwoVirtualMonitors a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:TwoVirtualMonitors ; rdfs:label "xrandr --setmonitor"@en ; skos:definition "With two virtual monitors named left and right added, xrandr listed 3 monitors (left, right and screen), size() still returned (1920, 1080), onScreen(1500, 500) was True and the fail-safe points began with (0, 0) and (0, 1079), the corners of the whole screen; no real second monitor was used (NOT EXECUTED)."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch23/research> .
