chx:X_DoubleAndTriple a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:DoubleAndTriple ; rdfs:label "pyautogui.tripleClick()"@en ; skos:definition "doubleClick sent two presses of button 1 and Tk saw one double click, tripleClick sent three and Tk saw a double and a triple click, while click(clicks=2, interval=0.6) was seen by Tk as no double click, and doubleClick(button='right') sent button 3 twice, which the Tk binding for button 1 does not count."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch23/research> .
