chx:X_SpiralDrawing a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:SpiralDrawing ; rdfs:label "spiralDraw.py as printed"@en ; skos:definition "The chapter's spiral loop with its pause cut to 0.5 seconds made 32 drag calls, the first (300, 0), (0, 280), (-280, 0), (0, -260) and (260, 0), and drew inside the box (180, 129, 481, 411)."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch23/research> .
