chx:X_MouseInfoWindow a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:MouseInfoWindow ; rdfs:label "mouseinfo.MouseInfoWindow"@en ; skos:definition "Under Tk 8.6.14 the MouseInfo 0.1.3 window showed the pointer at 1500,800 with the color 130,135,144 and #828790, and F6 pressed with the delay on logged 1600,850, the place of the pointer 3 seconds later, and not 1500,800."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch23/research> .
