chx:X_ScreenshotNeedsScrot a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:ScreenshotNeedsScrot ; rdfs:label "scrot"@en ; skos:definition "With scrot on the PATH screenshot() returned a PngImageFile, and with the PATH emptied it ended with return code 1 and an error that names gnome-screenshot."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch23/research> .
