chx:X_ImageNotFound a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:ImageNotFound ; rdfs:label "pyautogui.ImageNotFoundException"@en ; skos:definition "An image one pixel off raised pyautogui.ImageNotFoundException from locateOnScreen and from click, pyscreeze.locateOnScreen raised the class of pyscreeze, which is not the class of pyautogui, and useImageNotFoundException(False) made locateOnScreen return None."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch23/research> .
