chx:X_WindowAttributes a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:WindowAttributes ; rdfs:label "pyrect.Rect(500, 300, 2070, 1208)"@en ; skos:definition "The Rect class that PyGetWindow builds its windows on, given the numbers of the chapter's window, gave right 2570, bottom 1508, topleft Point(x=500, y=300), center Point(x=1535, y=904), size Size(width=2070, height=1208), area 2500560 and box Box(left=500, top=300, width=2070, height=1208)."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch23/research> .
