chx:X_HotkeyOrder a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:HotkeyOrder ; rdfs:label "pyautogui.hotkey('ctrl', 'c')"@en ; skos:definition "hotkey('ctrl', 'c') produced the same four events as keyDown('ctrl'), keyDown('c'), keyUp('c') and keyUp('ctrl'), pressing Control_L and c and releasing c and Control_L, and hotkey('ctrl', 'alt', 'shift', 's') produced 8 events."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch23/research> .
