chx:X_IdleResets a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:IdleResets ; rdfs:label "xprintidle"@en ; skos:definition "The X idle time was reset by move and by press but not by position, size or screenshot: after move(1, 0) it was under 0.4 seconds, after press('shift') under 0.4 seconds, and after position, size and a wait it was over 1 second, and after screenshot it was over 1 second."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch23/research> .
