chx:X_PyMsgBoxReleases a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:PyMsgBoxReleases ; rdfs:label "pymsgbox.__version__"@en ; skos:definition "The installed PyMsgBox is 2.0.1 although its module says __version__ 1.0.9, its button texts are OK and Cancel, its timeout value is Timeout, and confirm and password carry type hints, confirm returning Optional[str]."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch23/research> .
